{"candidateAnswer":"Dog grooming","evidence":"[D16:2 | 9:19 pm on 19 August, 2023] Audrey: Hi Andrew! The cafe sounds great, and the hike pic's great! August's been eventful - I learned a new skill! It was really awesome, making sure they were pampered and happy. I've always loved caring for my pups, and now taking care of their grooming myself makes me closer to them. They look so cute post-grooming!\n[D17:4 | 12:24 am on 24 August, 2023] Audrey: Yeah they really do enjoy the mountain life. Regular grooming is essential to keep them looking good. Daily brushing, regular baths, nail trims, and lots of love is what helps them stay healthy and happy. It's all about keeping them in good shape.","itemId":"urn:uuid:c574667d-5b4e-5830-a704-4b8e6cde935a","provenance":{"sourceCommitment":"sha256:5fd3db7d080f1b8262fe4ef162156b5eaa4edc2674d53c9a0e560e18e469530a","timestamp":"2026-04-02T14:22:55Z"},"question":"What is a skill that Audrey learned to take care of her dogs?","referenceAnswer":"Grooming","sources":[{"digest":{"sha256":"5fd3db7d080f1b8262fe4ef162156b5eaa4edc2674d53c9a0e560e18e469530a"}}]}